DESCRIPTION:Gather Café in Alton This ride was pulled from the WW archive
 s to add variety at the end of the season. Both routes face a fairly chall
 enging climb on an unpaved road near the start of the ride\, then roll alo
 ng beautiful country roads\, through some of the prettiest towns in the ar
 ea. Both routes stop for lunch at The Gather Cafe in Alton\, then continue
  south\, climbing past the Caledon Ski Club. The routes diverge at Forks o
 f the Credit Rd where the shorter route goes through Belfountain\, where r
 efreshments are available\, while the longer route offers the thrilling op
 tion of riding down the switchbacks and through Inglewood. The two routes 
 meet again at Creditview Rd\, riding through Cheltenha...
