 2026 Trip Leader: Carl Friesen . 647-998-4057. cfriesen@rogers.com For tho
 se who missed the earlier Simcoe County Loop multi-day ride\, here’s ano
 ther chance to ride a similar route\, the Simcoe County Loop Trail\, that 
